+ * Distributed under the terms of the MIT License.
+ *
+ * meson_vdec's HEVC block (experimental, PLAN.md M26 stage 3): a
+ * feasibility test of the S905's HEVC decoder with linux-firmware's
+ * gxl_hevc.bin (MESON_VDEC_HEVC) or the vendor kernel's microcode
+ * (MESON_VDEC_HEVC_VENDOR). It decodes intra pictures of 8-bit streams to
+ * NV12 and skips the others. The register facts are in the port's
+ * docs/m26-vdec-hevc-facts.md and docs/m26-vdec-hevc-vendor-facts.md.
+ *
+ * Unlike VDEC_1's firmware, the HEVC firmware only parses: it reports each
+ * slice segment header (status 8) with the parameters it parsed (the RPM),
+ * and the host programs the picture's buffers and the slice's decoding and
+ * tells it to go on. The mailbox interrupt stays masked; the waits poll the
+ * status register.
+ */
